        rdfs:comment                   "Sheer tabby-woven linen with narrow, textured weft stripes, embroidered at ends with polychrome silks and gold yarns in double darning, double running and satin stitches. Pattern shows a row of three flowering trees above a band of small plants and trees. Short warp fring at ends. Slight stains."@en ;
